# Paths excluded from the Cloudflare Pages deploy directory.
# Python fnmatch semantics: '*' crosses '/', patterns match from the repo root.
# The Cloudflare deploy is built from `git ls-files`, so untracked files and
# .git/ are never included regardless of what is listed here.

# --- Source exam PDFs (46 MB): not part of the rendered site --------------
*.pdf

# --- Owner-only tooling and editor: not part of the student site ----------
editor.html
editor-local.html
server.py
pdf_processor.py
netlify.toml
*owner-editor.js
*owner-editor.css
assets/editor-*

# --- Experimental prototype ----------------------------------------------
prototype/*

# --- Repo metadata --------------------------------------------------------
CNAME
README.md
REVIEW-CONTEXT.md
.cfignore
.gitignore
